1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:04,121
Before you buy another coat this winter,
stop.

2
00:00:04,821 --> 00:00:08,853
Elegant women never wear these seven
things when it's cold,

3
00:00:09,203 --> 00:00:12,467
and number four is in almost every closet.

4
00:00:13,367 --> 00:00:14,861
In today's video,

5
00:00:15,111 --> 00:00:19,932
we're revealing the seven things truly
elegant women avoid in winter,

6
00:00:20,282 --> 00:00:23,269
and more importantly, what they wear
instead,

7
00:00:23,619 --> 00:00:25,005
to stay warm,

8
00:00:25,305 --> 00:00:26,351
polished,

9
00:00:26,651 --> 00:00:28,677
and effortlessly expensive.

10
00:00:29,427 --> 00:00:33,331
Because being cold has never been the
secret to elegance.

11
00:00:34,131 --> 00:00:36,094
Some of these may surprise you,

12
00:00:36,394 --> 00:00:40,746
but once you see them, you'll never unsee
them. Let's get started.

13
00:00:41,946 --> 00:00:45,978
Number one. Flat, lifeless black, from
head to toe.

14
00:00:46,778 --> 00:00:49,509
We get it. Black feels safe in winter.

15
00:00:49,859 --> 00:00:51,011
It's easy,

16
00:00:51,311 --> 00:00:52,847
it hides everything,

17
00:00:53,147 --> 00:00:54,875
and it always matches.

18
00:00:55,475 --> 00:00:58,814
But when every piece is the same dull
black, the outfit can start to feel heavy

19
00:00:58,814 --> 00:01:02,152
instead of chic.

20
00:01:02,952 --> 00:01:05,512
Elegant women don't avoid black.

21
00:01:05,862 --> 00:01:07,441
They give it texture.

22
00:01:08,041 --> 00:01:09,705
A black cashmere knit,

23
00:01:10,005 --> 00:01:11,733
with black leather gloves.

24
00:01:12,233 --> 00:01:14,195
A black velvet blazer,

25
00:01:14,495 --> 00:01:16,373
over a silk camisole.

26
00:01:17,173 --> 00:01:19,818
Or step into the softer side of winter.

27
00:01:20,268 --> 00:01:21,420
Winter white,

28
00:01:21,720 --> 00:01:22,680
cream,

29
00:01:22,980 --> 00:01:23,876
camel,

30
00:01:24,176 --> 00:01:25,733
and chocolate brown,

31
00:01:26,083 --> 00:01:27,705
worn tone on tone.

32
00:01:28,405 --> 00:01:32,906
It's not about giving up black. It's about
making it look intentional.

33
00:01:33,706 --> 00:01:37,205
Try this. One black outfit, three
textures.

34
00:01:37,705 --> 00:01:38,985
A fine knit,

35
00:01:39,285 --> 00:01:41,034
a smooth wool trouser,

36
00:01:41,334 --> 00:01:43,083
and a soft leather glove.

37
00:01:43,783 --> 00:01:48,221
Suddenly the same colour looks deliberate,
layered, and so chic.

38
00:01:48,921 --> 00:01:52,782
And if you'd love more colour, a camel
coat over all black is one of the most

39
00:01:52,782 --> 00:01:56,643
timeless winter pairings there is.

40
00:01:57,743 --> 00:02:00,773
Number two. Pilled, tired knitwear.

41
00:02:01,573 --> 00:02:05,786
Your sweater might be beautiful, but if
it's covered in little fuzz balls, it

42
00:02:05,786 --> 00:02:09,999
quietly tells the world it has been
forgotten.

43
00:02:10,849 --> 00:02:15,116
This is one of those details you may not
notice, but others do.

44
00:02:15,966 --> 00:02:20,339
Instead, take two minutes with a fabric
shaver before you head out,

45
00:02:21,189 --> 00:02:23,579
fold your knits instead of hanging them,

46
00:02:24,429 --> 00:02:30,338
and when you buy new, choose merino, wool,
or cashmere blends that hold their shape.

47
00:02:31,188 --> 00:02:34,484
A simple, well-kept knit will always look
more expensive than a new one that's

48
00:02:34,484 --> 00:02:37,780
already tired.

49
00:02:38,630 --> 00:02:41,190
The same goes for your winter basics.

50
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,832
Gloves with loose threads,

51
00:02:44,282 --> 00:02:46,586
a scarf that's lost its softness,

52
00:02:47,036 --> 00:02:49,468
boots with salt stains along the edge.

53
00:02:50,318 --> 00:02:52,878
Wipe your boots when you come home, and
give your knits a little rest between

54
00:02:52,878 --> 00:02:55,438
wears.

55
00:02:56,288 --> 00:02:59,531
Those small moments of care add up, and
they show.

56
00:03:00,631 --> 00:03:03,873
Number three. Novelty holiday sweaters.

57
00:03:04,673 --> 00:03:07,884
Let's be clear. If a reindeer sweater
makes your family laugh at Christmas, wear

58
00:03:07,884 --> 00:03:11,095
it with joy.

59
00:03:11,945 --> 00:03:16,115
But for holiday dinners and parties,
elegant women let the season show through

60
00:03:16,115 --> 00:03:20,286
colour and fabric, not cartoons.

61
00:03:21,136 --> 00:03:23,141
Think a deep burgundy knit,

62
00:03:23,591 --> 00:03:25,469
an emerald silk blouse,

63
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:27,860
or a velvet midi skirt.

64
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:33,574
These are the colours of the season, and
they look rich without saying a word.

65
00:03:34,424 --> 00:03:38,947
Festive doesn't have to mean loud. It just
has to feel like you.

66
00:03:39,797 --> 00:03:42,741
And if you love colour, this is your
season.

67
00:03:43,591 --> 00:03:46,023
Rich jewel tones like burgundy,

68
00:03:46,473 --> 00:03:47,475
emerald,

69
00:03:47,925 --> 00:03:48,800
plum,

70
00:03:49,250 --> 00:03:55,181
and deep navy flatter so many skin tones
and look stunning against a winter coat.

71
00:03:56,031 --> 00:04:00,703
You don't have to choose between joyful
and elegant. You can be both.

72
00:04:01,553 --> 00:04:04,582
And here's a little secret. Many of the
most elegant women have one thing in

73
00:04:04,582 --> 00:04:07,611
common.

74
00:04:08,461 --> 00:04:13,731
They know exactly which colours flatter
them, so winter dressing feels easy.

75
00:04:14,581 --> 00:04:18,528
If you'd like to discover your best
colours, silhouettes, and pieces, our

76
00:04:18,528 --> 00:04:22,474
personal stylist guide is linked in the
description. It's sent instantly to your

77
00:04:22,474 --> 00:04:26,421
email.

78
00:04:27,521 --> 00:04:29,846
Number four. The fleece zip-up.

79
00:04:30,646 --> 00:04:35,489
Here it is, number four, and it really is
in almost every closet.

80
00:04:36,339 --> 00:04:40,925
It's warm and comfortable, and we
understand why we reach for it.

81
00:04:41,775 --> 00:04:46,351
But fleece is sporty by nature, and the
moment it goes over a nice outfit, the

82
00:04:46,351 --> 00:04:50,927
whole look starts to feel like a walk to
the gym.

83
00:04:51,777 --> 00:04:56,769
The secret to being warm and elegant is
thin layers, not thick ones.

84
00:04:57,619 --> 00:05:01,481
Start with a fine merino or silk thermal
underneath,

85
00:05:01,931 --> 00:05:03,403
add a soft knit,

86
00:05:03,853 --> 00:05:06,199
then finish with a structured coat.

87
00:05:07,049 --> 00:05:10,249
You'll be just as warm, and so much more
polished.

88
00:05:11,099 --> 00:05:16,390
And for the days when you truly want
comfort, a cashmere or wool cardigan,

89
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:18,611
a long knit coatigan,

90
00:05:19,061 --> 00:05:24,405
or a soft quilted jacket in a neutral
shade gives you that same cosy feeling,

91
00:05:24,405 --> 00:05:29,749
while still looking put together when you
run into someone you know.

92
00:05:30,849 --> 00:05:33,665
Number five. Too much sparkle at once.

93
00:05:34,465 --> 00:05:38,539
Holiday season is the time to shine, and
we love that.

94
00:05:39,389 --> 00:05:44,274
But when the sequins, the glitter heels,
the statement earrings, and the metallic

95
00:05:44,274 --> 00:05:49,160
bag all arrive together, the outfit starts
competing with you.

96
00:05:50,010 --> 00:05:55,407
Elegant women choose one moment of sparkle
and let everything else stay calm.

97
00:05:56,257 --> 00:05:59,991
A satin or velvet dress with simple gold
earrings.

98
00:06:00,841 --> 00:06:03,721
A sequin skirt with a soft cashmere knit.

99
00:06:04,571 --> 00:06:08,816
One focal point, and everything else
quietly supporting it.

100
00:06:09,666 --> 00:06:15,106
The same idea works for the office party.
A velvet blazer over a silk camisole,

101
00:06:15,106 --> 00:06:20,546
tailored trousers, and one pair of
beautiful earrings.

102
00:06:21,396 --> 00:06:25,150
Refined, festive, and never trying too
hard. Because true elegance whispers, even

103
00:06:25,150 --> 00:06:28,905
in December.

104
00:06:30,005 --> 00:06:33,312
Number six. A coat that fights your
outfit.

105
00:06:34,112 --> 00:06:37,014
Your coat is the first thing people see
all winter, so it deserves a little

106
00:06:37,014 --> 00:06:39,915
attention.

107
00:06:40,765 --> 00:06:45,703
The most common mistake is a coat that's
shorter than your dress or skirt, so the

108
00:06:45,703 --> 00:06:50,642
hem peeks out underneath, or sleeves that
hang over your hands.

109
00:06:51,492 --> 00:06:56,175
Instead, choose a coat that's longer than
your hemline, in wool or a wool blend, in

110
00:06:56,175 --> 00:07:00,857
camel, charcoal, navy, or chocolate.

111
00:07:01,707 --> 00:07:04,374
A belted style adds shape at the waist.

112
00:07:05,224 --> 00:07:08,722
And remember, a simple sleeve adjustment
from a tailor costs very little and

113
00:07:08,722 --> 00:07:12,221
changes everything.

114
00:07:13,071 --> 00:07:17,658
It's not about owning many coats. It's
about owning one that fits.

115
00:07:18,508 --> 00:07:23,393
And don't forget what goes with it. A soft
scarf in cashmere or wool,

116
00:07:23,843 --> 00:07:25,123
leather gloves,

117
00:07:25,573 --> 00:07:29,179
and sleek knee-high boots in black or
chocolate brown.

118
00:07:30,029 --> 00:07:33,378
These few pieces, chosen well, will carry
you through every cold morning and every

119
00:07:33,378 --> 00:07:36,727
evening out.

120
00:07:37,827 --> 00:07:41,155
Number seven. An overpowering winter
scent.

121
00:07:41,955 --> 00:07:45,518
Warm, rich fragrances feel beautiful in
winter.

122
00:07:46,368 --> 00:07:50,187
But in heated rooms, cars, and crowded
parties, too much can fill the space

123
00:07:50,187 --> 00:07:54,005
before you even say hello.

124
00:07:54,855 --> 00:07:58,887
Elegant women let their scent be
discovered, not announced.

125
00:07:59,737 --> 00:08:01,807
One or two sprays is enough.

126
00:08:02,657 --> 00:08:06,582
Choose something soft and warm, like
vanilla, amber, or sandalwood, and let it

127
00:08:06,582 --> 00:08:10,507
be the quiet finishing touch.

128
00:08:11,357 --> 00:08:15,016
Because when you walk into a room warm,
polished, and softly scented, that's

129
00:08:15,016 --> 00:08:18,675
unforgettable elegance.

130
00:08:19,525 --> 00:08:22,906
And the same softness applies to
everything else this season. Lips cared

131
00:08:22,906 --> 00:08:26,287
for with a little balm,

132
00:08:26,737 --> 00:08:28,828
hands kept smooth with cream,

133
00:08:29,278 --> 00:08:34,014
hair calmed with a touch of serum when the
dry air makes it static.

134
00:08:34,864 --> 00:08:37,488
Those quiet details complete the look.

135
00:08:38,588 --> 00:08:41,425
So this winter, give black some texture,

136
00:08:41,875 --> 00:08:43,219
care for your knits,

137
00:08:43,669 --> 00:08:45,845
let colour be your festive touch,

138
00:08:46,295 --> 00:08:48,365
trade fleece for thin layers,

139
00:08:48,815 --> 00:08:50,905
choose one moment of sparkle,

140
00:08:51,355 --> 00:08:53,062
find a coat that fits,

141
00:08:53,512 --> 00:08:55,240
and keep your scent soft.

142
00:08:55,940 --> 00:08:59,225
Warm, comfortable, and elegant, all at
once.

143
00:09:00,025 --> 00:09:03,929
There are so many more ways to stay
elegant through winter. If you'd like a

144
00:09:03,929 --> 00:09:07,833
part two, let us know in the comments.

145
00:09:08,533 --> 00:09:13,995
Thank you so much for spending your time
with us today. Your personal stylist guide

146
00:09:13,995 --> 00:09:19,456
is linked in the description. Until next
time, bye everyone.
